# Design owners for the Astryx repository
# Design-team members. This list has three responsibilities:
#
# - Current design and theme specs, component/module Design decisions, and
#   normative design assets may be approved by any DESIGNOWNER; an approval
#   binds the spec content (architecture:knowledge-contracts DEC-14). ENGOWNERS
#   may approve every spec.
# - A DESIGNOWNER approves with a review or `/approve-spec <sha>`, like every
#   other owner; in a mixed PR every other applicable code or
#   spec-owner group remains required. A classifier-proven appearance-only Core
#   runtime change may bypass the engineering review gate only when no other
#   code reason applies. The gate decides approval only; it never enables
#   auto-merge.
# - Review tooling may use the list to frame design-authored changes.
#
# This is not general merge permission. Design approval alone never
# authorizes non-design records or mixed code/spec changes.
#
# Uses the same @handle format as CODEOWNERS. Keep this list current.

